# Mobile app — removed from the repo (Expo/React Native client, kept locally
# only). Untracked; do not push. Anchored to the repo root so it does NOT also
# match web/app/ (the Next.js App Router dir).
/app/

# Data folder. The datasets and caches here are large and rebuildable from the
# scripts, and some are past GitHub's 100 MB file limit, so nothing under data/
# is committed. Only data/README.md is tracked, to document the folder.
data/*
!data/README.md

# Runtime caches (NDVI per-location JSON files, etc.)
api/cache/

